            <ArticleTitle>Novel double catheter technique in complex percutaneous coronary interventions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>912-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a novel double catheter technique for successful complex intervention of a very old proximal left circumflex chronic total occlusion (&gt;10 years old). Prior attempts of guide wire passage using bare wire alone, over-the wire balloon or microcatheter support techniques were unsuccessful.</AbstractText>
